  "reconciliation": "User approved DM Serif Display Regular/Italic on 2026-10-16 after live contents master 1345:23708 exposed omission in packaged font list. Only Ankara masthead, slogan, Castle cover and Contents heading.",
  "opticalSizeReconciliation": "Fraunces static instances pin opsz to the approved role size (20/21/25/36/39/41) to reproduce Figma optical-size rendering. Default upstream opsz=9 widened the 20px Gordion standfirst to five lines; official opsz=20 produces the approved four lines. WONK=1 and SOFT=0 remain fixed.",
